+        <div class="callout now">
+          <h3>What changed since this plan was written</h3>
+          <p>H13 roles and medics (0.13.0) merged to master on 5 October 2026 (<code>415f34a5</code>), and Cops N Crooks 0.15.0 “Lose them” merged the same day (master <code>9d4776ad</code>). The eight steps below are the chase as audited on 0.12.0 and the 0.13.0 branch. On 0.15.0:</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li><b>Step 1, a rival goes down:</b> the heat ledger replaces the kill combo. Each kill is a crime (Kill_Player 80 heat, ×1.5 for a repeat inside 10 s, ×1.5 if a cop saw it, ×0.5 inside a contested turf) and 100 heat is the first star. Self-defence, defending your own contested turf, killing an ally or gangmate and your own arrow are not crimes.</li>
+            <li><b>Step 3, punching an officer:</b> a hit on a cop is now a crime, Assault_Cop 100 heat, so one star, at most once per attacker and cop every 10 s. A killed cop adds Kill_Cop 150, so a one-shot cop kill lands at two stars.</li>
+            <li><b>Step 6, the basement:</b> stars fall by staying unseen. 3 s out of sight starts a countdown in a search zone (radius 40/60/90/130/180 blocks by stars, 10/20/30/45/60 s per star, one star at a time); a sighting resets it and leaving the zone runs it twice as fast. Repeating_Timer stays the safety net when no cop is alive. A star drop costs nothing by default (<code>Take_Money.Enable</code> false).</li>
+            <li><b>Step 7, the roof:</b> death still resets your stars and bills 15% of the wallet, but a broken death formula now falls back to 15% with one warning instead of throwing, the bill is clamped to the wallet, and <code>Lose_Money: false</code> charges nothing (it used to pay you).</li>
+            <li><b>Step 8, the money when you're busted:</b> intake hands you a charge sheet, min(10,000, 200 + 250 × stars at arrest), paid from the wallet only, with the shortfall served as extra time (0.1 s per dollar, at most 600 s). Bounties pay only what players posted; the server-made part is notoriety.</li>
+          </ul>
+          <p>Steps 2, 4 and 5 gain the star card, siren and boss bar, and in step 4 two cops down within 20 s make the rest pull back and push together when backup lands. From "Also missing": assault on a cop, resisting arrest and civilian kills now publish crimes (the other weights ship dormant), the civilian star has a decay clock and counts once, and gunfire gives you away.<span class="ref">Spec and evidence: <code>brainstorming/cnc-overhaul-2026-10-05/</code> (SPEC-0.15.md, PLAN.md, reviews/); acceptance R1-R4 and N1-N8 pass in the sandbox harness.</span></p>
+        </div>
